WEBVTT

00:09:58.197 --> 00:10:00.263
and she'd go home disappointed.

00:10:01.663 --> 00:10:02.863
At this point,

00:10:02.863 --> 00:10:05.030
she was in a chest brace and a wheelchair

00:10:05.063 --> 00:10:07.363
because her bones
could no longer support her.

00:10:11.697 --> 00:10:16.030
It’s easy for us to think
of design as aesthetics

00:10:16.063 --> 00:10:17.697
or creating visuals.

00:10:18.197 --> 00:10:21.397
Design is also a tool for communication,

00:10:21.430 --> 00:10:24.397
a combination of creativity and empathy.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:27.697
Earlier, I referred to my mom's death
as a design challenge,

00:10:27.697 --> 00:10:31.163
which I know sounds strange
and off-putting.